I can make it – Carles Vallecillo
Martial Arts & Life Coach with a very honest and down-to-earth approach: No snake oils, no fancy tricks – I want you to succeed. And I will do all that’s within my reach to do so. Are you willing to walk the walk?

My specialties are Strength, Resilience, Confidence, Mindset & Masculinity.

Coaching Services
Career, Goal Setting & Self Development, Health & Lifestyle, Motivation & Time Management, Relationships & Personal Issues, Stress Management, Team Management

About Me
Carles is a Martial Arts & Life Coach certified by the ICF with more than 20 years of experience solving problems. Including training in several roles (5+ years as a full time trainer), helping people solve their own problems through empowering them and offering knowledge when needed. If there is an industry that is big in problem solving, that is IT.

And while it may sound unrelated, IT has taught Carles to go deeper into the world of ‘problem solving’ all the way down into people, communities and social behavior (the real ‘hard problems’ are not fixing an operating system or setting up a honeypot network – the real hard ones are people. And their relationships with others and with themselves).

Helped many people achieve their life goals – sometimes the ones they were struggling with for more than decades.

He keeps walking the talk, constantly upskilling through courses on problem solving, emotional intelligence, people skills, etc. – and that is what puts him a position to be able to leverage his knowledge to help others.

‘And that is what makes it all worth it – being able to help others do better and be better‘

Carles is also a leader in different communities and enjoys spending his free time being in the zone doing martial arts as well as playing music and being in nature.

